  "intro": {
    "language": "en",
    "text": "Wang Xing (Chinese: 王兴; born 18 February 1979) is a Chinese businessman who co-founded Meituan in 2010 and is its chairman and CEO. He previously co-founded the social network Xiaonei, later renamed Renren, and the microblogging service Fanfou.\n\n",
